---
import { confusionMatrix } from "../data/r-machine-learning";

// A faithful visual trace of the audited ROC figure. No threshold-level counts are inferred.
const curve =
  "M 54 282 C 56 187, 72 129, 114 90 C 160 48, 235 29, 346 23 C 430 18, 500 17, 566 17";
---

<section class="native-roc" aria-labelledby="native-roc-title">
  <div class="native-roc__heading">
    <span>ROC</span>
    <div>
      <h3 id="native-roc-title">留出集上的排序能力</h3><p>
        曲线与随机基准共同说明模型在不同分类边界下的区分方向；AUC 来自 39,200
        条留出记录。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="native-roc__layout">
    <figure>
      <svg
        viewBox="0 0 620 340"
        role="img"
        aria-labelledby="native-roc-svg-title native-roc-svg-desc"
      >
        <title id="native-roc-svg-title">Logistic Regression 的 ROC 曲线</title>
        <desc id="native-roc-svg-desc"
          >曲线位于随机基准上方，留出集 AUC 为 0.9053。</desc
        >
        <g class="native-roc__grid" aria-hidden="true"
          >{
            [54, 182, 310, 438, 566].map((point) => (
              <>
                <>
                  <line x1={point} y1="17" x2={point} y2="282" />
                  <line x1="54" y1={299 - point / 2} x2="566" y2={299 - point / 2} />
                </>
              </>
            ))
          }</g
        >
        <line class="native-roc__random" x1="54" y1="282" x2="566" y2="17"></line>
        <path class="native-roc__curve" d={curve}></path>
        <line class="native-roc__axis" x1="54" y1="282" x2="576" y2="282"></line><line
          class="native-roc__axis"
          x1="54"
          y1="292"
          x2="54"
          y2="8"></line>
        <text x="310" y="328">1 − Specificity</text><text
          x="15"
          y="154"
          transform="rotate(-90 15 154)">Sensitivity</text
        >
      </svg>
    </figure>
    <dl>
      <div><dt>Hold-out AUC</dt><dd>{confusionMatrix.auc.toFixed(4)}</dd></div><div>
        <dt>Sensitivity</dt><dd>{confusionMatrix.sensitivity.toFixed(4)}</dd>
      </div><div>
        <dt>Specificity</dt><dd>{confusionMatrix.specificity.toFixed(4)}</dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <p class="native-roc__note">
    AUC
    描述整体排序能力；逐阈值计数没有在可用结果中保留，因此页面不输出无法精确复算的阈值推演。
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .native-roc {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--colour-surface);
  }
  .native-roc__heading {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .native-roc__heading > span {
    height: max-content;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: var(--colour-primary-strong);
    font: 700 0.7rem/1 var(--font-mono);
  }
  h3,
  p,
  dl,
  dt,
  dd,
  figure {
    margin: 0;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }
  .native-roc__heading p,
  .native-roc__note {
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .native-roc__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(12rem, 0.7fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .native-roc svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    overflow: visible;
  }
  .native-roc__grid line {
    stroke: var(--colour-border);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .native-roc__random {
    stroke: var(--colour-text-muted);
    stroke-dasharray: 7 7;
  }
  .native-roc__curve {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--colour-primary-strong);
    stroke-width: 6;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }
  .native-roc__axis {
    stroke: var(--colour-text);
  }
  text {
    fill: var(--colour-text-muted);
    font: 14px var(--font-sans);
  }
  dl {
    display: grid;
    border: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
  }
  dl div {
    padding: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--colour-border);
  }
  dl div:last-child {
    border: 0;
  }
  dt {
    color: var(--colour-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  dd {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    font: 750 clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 2rem)/1 var(--font-display);
  }
  .native-roc__note {
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--colour-accent);
  }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .native-roc__heading,
    .native-roc__layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
